纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/a03e158968cf63490b7ea1d52bdaea928e33b44d/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-291/year-0953/part-03/sources/library/songshi-271-zhangcangying/source.txt", "note": "《宋史》卷271·张藏英传，段落 songshi-9c6e46fee832-p058967；已核上下文及传主，纸本及异文待核。", "id": "8edcec80-faf6-5c90-95af-0feefd563eee"}, {"title": "资治通鉴·卷291·广顺三年六月至十二月", "source_type": "primary", "author": "司马光等", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/a03e158968cf63490b7ea1d52bdaea928e33b44d/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-291/year-0953/part-03/sources/library/tongjian-291-953-june-december/source.txt", "note": "《资治通鉴》卷291·广顺三年六月至十二月，段落 zizhi-tongjian-a63549944a71-p003458；已核上下文及传主，纸本及异文待核。", "id": "ef9b7b67-6d1a-52f9-b2db-fffd976d2c68"}, {"title": "资治通鉴·卷291·广顺三年二月至五月", "source_type": "primary", "author": "司马光等", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/0712155a855a3f88decd328f54992920391e363e/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-291/year-0953/part-02/sources/library/tongjian-291-953-february-march/source.txt", "note": "《资治通鉴》卷291·广顺三年二月至五月，段落 zizhi-tongjian-a63549944a71-p003457；已核上下文及传主，纸本及异文待核。", "id": "860558e2-1135-5a40-84b3-c70f490d2797"}, {"title": "新五代史·卷66·楚世家第六·刘言", "source_type": "primary", "author": "欧阳修", "edition": "选定TXT逐字导出；电子本，纸本及异文待核。", "url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/0712155a855a3f88decd328f54992920391e363e/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-291/year-0953/part-02/sources/library/xinwudaishi-66-he-zhu-killed/source.txt", "note": "《新五代史》卷66·楚世家第六·刘言，段落 xin-wudaishi-b08f244b9241-p003337；已核上下文及传主，纸本及异文待核。", "id": "484e7b25-2340-55e8-a054-33bb2cc42e4b"}]'::jsonb)
